      "source_xml_line": 2279,
      "string_id": "volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "%c[255,255,128,128]Wolf, what did you want to tell me? I got your message when I was at the carpark.%c[default]",
      "JA_current": "%c[255,255,128,128]Wolf, what did you want to tell me? I got your message when I was at the carpark.%c[default]",
      "JA_new": "%c[255,255,128,128]ウルフ、何か話があるって？ 駐車場にいた時、連絡をもらった。%c[default]",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "volk_about_nastavnik",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2282,
      "string_id": "volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yes, Marked One, after you dealt with the bandits, I realized that you're not just a rookie who's lost his memory, but probably a pretty experienced stalker. My point is this: a good man needs help, and I'd like you to help him. I think it's within your power. And it's a good deal, by the way.",
      "JA_current": "Yes, Marked One, after you dealt with the bandits, I realized that you're not just a rookie who's lost his memory, but probably a pretty experienced stalker. My point is this: a good man needs help, and I'd like you to help him. I think it's within your power. And it's a good deal, by the way.",
      "JA_new": "ああ、印付き。バンディットを片付けた後、お前は記憶をなくしただけの新米じゃない、かなり腕の立つストーカーかもしれないと思った。つまり、いい奴が助けを必要としてる。お前に力を貸してほしいんだ。お前ならできると思う。それに、悪くない話だぞ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "volk_about_nastavnik",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2285,
      "string_id": "volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What kind of guy is he?",
      "JA_current": "What kind of guy is he?",
      "JA_new": "どんな奴なんだ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "volk_about_nastavnik",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2288,
      "string_id": "volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "They call him Mentor. He is a veteran of the Zone, but recently he and his group had problems and need the help of experienced stalkers. Mentor is a great friend of our Sidorovich, they say that he once apparently saved his life.",
      "JA_current": "They call him Mentor. He is a veteran of the Zone, but recently he and his group had problems and need the help of experienced stalkers. Mentor is a great friend of our Sidorovich, they say that he once apparently saved his life.",
      "JA_new": "メンターと呼ばれてる。ゾーンを知り尽くしたベテランだ。だが最近、仲間と問題を抱えていて、腕の立つストーカーの助けが必要らしい。シドロヴィッチとは古くからの親友で、昔、命を救ったこともあるそうだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "volk_about_nastavnik",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2291,
      "string_id": "volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Where can I find him?",
      "JA_current": "Where can I find him?",
      "JA_new": "どこにいる？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "volk_about_nastavnik",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2294,
      "string_id": "volk_about_nastavnik_phrase_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "He is here in the village right now. He's staying in that red, roofless house across the street. You can go up to him right now.",
      "JA_current": "He is here in the village right now. He's staying in that red, roofless house across the street. You can go up to him right now.",
      "JA_new": "今は村にいる。通りの向かいにある、赤い屋根のない家にいるよ。すぐ会いに行ける。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "volk_about_nastavnik",
          "phrase_id": "5",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
